    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's EcoVadis rating, carbon footprint, green hosting partners, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and known sustainability trade-offs as of 2024, what CSR and sustainability measures can our company's implement to meet these requirements?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address The City of Belval environmental requirements, our company's, can leverage our company's existing capabilities and commitments." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's can highlight our company's EcoVadis rating of Silver, which demonstrates our company's dedication to corporate social responsibility, including environmental practices.  our company's can also emphasize our company's goal to reduce our carbon footprint, currently at 148 tons of CO2e for Scope 1 and 2 emissions, by implementing digital sobriety practices such as INT8/INT4 model quantization, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching, and adhering to a green IT hardware procurement policy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "These practices not only reduce energy consumption but also contribute to lowering our carbon footprint. our company's partnership with green hosting providers like OVHcloud and Scaleway, both of which use 100% renewable energy and have ISO14001 certification, further supports our company's commitment to low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
