        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, our company's should note that while our company's are not currently ISO14001 certified, our company's have a target to achieve this certification by 2026, demonstrating our company's ongoing commitment to improving our environmental management systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of social commitments, our company's focus on gender equality, support for disabled workers, preference for local subcontracting, and adherence to accessibility standards like WCAG 2.1 AA and RGAA 4.1, demonstrate a broader commitment to sustainability that extends beyond environmental concerns. our company's AI ethics principles, including the requirement for human oversight, transparency of data sources, and the right to contest AI-generated suggestions, also underscore our company's dedication to responsible and ethical practices that can indirectly support environmental goals by promoting more thoughtful and deliberate use of technology." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, acknowledging known sustainability trade-offs such as balancing high availability with energy consumption, our company's can propose solutions like low-power standby modes or recommending clients subscribe to renewable energy Guarantee of Origin certificates for on-premise servers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

