        ex:hasText "As the Security & Compliance Officer for Nexus Engineering S.r.l., I can confirm that the solution have the necessary certifications and expertise to address these requirements. the solution hold ISO 27001 certification with a scope that includes the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems, which is relevant to this project. the solution ISO 27001 certification is valid until 2026-11-30." ;
