    <http://example.org/node/chunk81> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To comply with GDPR, the solution have appointed a Data Protection Officer (DPO) who can be contacted at dpo@nexus-engineering.it. the solution also have experience with the RGPD/GDPR regulatory framework and have implemented various GDPR instruments, including data anonymization tools such as Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk82> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding AI security controls, the solution have implemented measures to protect against prompt injection, ensure output PII redaction, detect adversarial input, and establish confidence threshold escalation. the solution also ensure model isolation through the solution inference API, with no direct model access for end-users, and conduct security reviews for model updates." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To guarantee high-level security, the solution enforce multi-factor authentication (MFA) using TOTP and hardware tokens (FIDO2), and have experience designing Role-Based Access Control (RBAC). the solution utilize Privileged Access Management (PAM) solutions such as CyberArk Conjur and HashiCorp Vault. the solution session timeout policy is set to 30 minutes, and the solution support Single Sign-On (SSO) protocols like SAML 2.0 and OpenID Connect." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For data protection, the solution ensure that all queries are logged, and the solution log immutability method uses append-only with SHA-256 hash chaining. the solution retain audit logs for 7 years and have the capability to export data to CNIL. the solution Real-Time SIEM integration uses tools like Wazuh and Elastic SIEM." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk85> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To address the sovereignty of data, the solution can ensure that all data is hosted within the the European Union territory, as required by The City of Belval. the solution also comply with the cross-border transfer policy, which prohibits transfers outside the European Union unless there is an explicit legal basis." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk86> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of security frameworks, the solution have experience with various regulatory frameworks, including the EU AI Act, RGS v2 (ANSSI), SecNumCloud, NIS2 Directive, and eIDAS. the solution can leverage this expertise to ensure that the solution solution meets these requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk87> a prov:Entity ;
